        <head>To Secretaries and Others.</head>
        <p>To Secretaries and Others.</p>
        <p>We shall be glad to receive from secretaries and others reports of, and comment upon, all kinds of games to form the basis of notes for Saturday's " Examiner" each week. Facts in the rough will be dealt with by our staff, but the matter should reach this office as early in the week as possible.</p>
